#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"The DNS module decides how domains are resolved before policy routing. In "
"Clash-family clients, DNS behavior strongly affects rule hit accuracy, "
"latency, and anti-pollution resilience."
msgstr ""
"DNS 模块决定在策略路由之前如何解析域名。在 Clash 家族客户端中，DNS 行为会显著"
"影响规则命中精度、延迟以及抗污染能力。"

