"表、按需 fake-IP 策略）配套使用。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"In practice, `dns-hijack: true` is commonly paired with fake-IP mode in "
"Clash-style deployments."
msgstr ""
"在实践中，Clash 风格部署通常将 `dns-hijack: true` 与 fake-IP 模式搭配使用。"

